				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				341,
				2
			],
			"Message": "feat(Common): Add centralized IPC Channel registry for Wind ↔ Mountain\n\nAdd a new Channel module in Common that enumerates all 147 IPC channel\nidentifiers used in Tauri invoke calls between Wind (TypeScript UI) and\nMountain (Rust backend). Previously these string identifiers were hand-kept\non both sides, causing drift where channels could be declared but lack\nimplementations.\n\nThe DefineChannels! macro generates the enum, AsStr(), All(), and FromStr\nimplementations from a single declarative list. The matching TypeScript\nconst object lives at Element/Wind/Source/IPC/Channel.ts, kept in sync\nby convention.\n\nThis provides a single source of truth for the IPC channel namespace,\neliminating the possibility of runtime \"unknown channel\" errors from\ntypos or missing implementations.",
			"SHA": "31e3df5ceaef701ab6d218de60156899dd4b64a7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-21T18:32:14Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				340,
				2
			],
			"Message": "docs(Common): Normalize version headers to Keep a Changelog format\n\nReplace em-dashes (—) with hyphens (-) in CHANGELOG version headers to comply with the Keep a Changelog specification. Also normalize a single em-dash in FileWatcherProvider.rs comment.\n\nThis ensures consistent formatting across the CHANGELOG and aligns with the upstream documentation standard.",
			"SHA": "f2200c8862f9f94716f417b024b02feeed1da8b4"
		},
